      ["'I don't drink tea.' (a man speaking): where does ਨਹੀਂ go?",["At the very end","At the start","Right before the verb","After ਹਾਂ"],2,"ਨਹੀਂ goes before the verb, and ਹਾਂ is usually dropped: ਮੈਂ ਚਾਹ ਨਹੀਂ ਪੀਂਦਾ."]
